+From: Kenneth Kasilag <kenneth@kasilag.me>
+Date: Wed, 15 Jul 2026 13:30:00 +0800
+Subject: [PATCH] net: ethernet: qualcomm: ppe: compose tunnel underlays
+
+Build the IP-in-IPv6 outer header from the routed forward path, including
+one outer 802.1Q tag and an optional PPPoE session.  Share the tunnel L3
+interface at the physical port for Ethernet/VLAN underlays, or attach it to
+the existing lifecycle-owned PPPoE session as the vendor transaction does.
